DIMDIAMETER

# 📄 WebCAD — Deep Pseudocode

## Engineering Annotation System

### Commands:

* DIMDIAMETER
* DIMSTYLE
* STYLE (TextStyle)

Target:

* WebCAD (Three.js CAD engine)
* AutoCAD 2.x/early R-style behavior
