# 🧩 PART 2 — DIMSTYLE SYSTEM

---

# 🧠 1. Purpose

`DIMSTYLE` provides:

```text id="i2oqqv"
named reusable dimension appearance rules
```

Like AutoCAD:

* ISO
* ANSI
* Mechanical

---

# 📦 2. Data Model

```pseudo id="jlwm57"
DimStyle {

  name

  textHeightPx

  arrowSizePx

  extensionOffset

  gapPx

  precision

  color

  suppressLeadingZeros

  textInsideAlign

  decimalSeparator
}
```

---

# 🚀 IMPORTANT

Style properties applied at RENDER TIME.

NOT baked into geometry.

---

# ⚙️ 3. Style Registry

```pseudo id="jlwm58"
DimStyleRegistry {

  styles : Map<String,DimStyle>

  currentStyleName
}
```

---

# 📐 4. DIMSTYLE Command

---

# Main Entry

```pseudo id="jlwm59"
COMMAND DIMSTYLE
```

---

# Supported Operations

| Operation | Behavior    |
| --------- | ----------- |
| LIST      | show styles |
| NEW       | create      |
| SET       | set current |
| DELETE    | remove      |

---

# 📋 LIST

```pseudo id="jlwm5a"
FUNCTION listDimStyles():

  FOR style IN registry:

      PRINT style.name
```

---

# ➕ NEW

```pseudo id="jlwm5b"
FUNCTION createDimStyle(name):

  style =
      clone(defaultStyle)

  style.name = name

  registry.add(style)
```

---

# 🎯 SET CURRENT

```pseudo id="jlwm5c"
FUNCTION setCurrentDimStyle(name):

  registry.currentStyleName = name
```

---

# 🚀 Newly created dimensions inherit current style.

---

# 📐 5. Render-Time Resolution

---

# IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURE

Dimension entity stores:

```pseudo id="jlwm5d"
styleId
```

Renderer resolves:

```pseudo id="jlwm5e"
style =
    registry.get(styleId)
```

---

# 🚀 This enables:

* global updates
* style edits
* standards switching

---

# ⚡ 6. Dimension Rendering With Style

```pseudo id="jlwm5f"
arrowSize =
    pixelsToWorld(
        style.arrowSizePx
    )
```

---

# Same for:

* text height
* gaps
* precision

---

---

# 🧩 PART 3 — TEXTSTYLE SYSTEM

---

# 🧠 1. Purpose

`STYLE` defines reusable text appearance.

Referenced by:

* TEXT
* DIMENSIONS
* LEADERS

---

# 📦 2. Data Model

```pseudo id="jlwm5g"
TextStyle {

  name

  fontFamily

  height

  widthFactor

  obliqueAngle

  upsideDown

  backwards

  vertical

  color
}
```

---

# 🚀 Similar to AutoCAD STYLE command.

---

# ⚙️ 3. Registry

```pseudo id="jlwm5h"
TextStyleRegistry {

  styles : Map<String,TextStyle>

  currentStyleName
}
```

---

# 📐 4. STYLE Command

---

# Main Entry

```pseudo id="jlwm5i"
COMMAND STYLE
```

---

# Supported Operations

| Operation | Behavior    |
| --------- | ----------- |
| LIST      | list styles |
| NEW       | create      |
| SET       | current     |
| MODIFY    | edit        |

---

# ➕ NEW

```pseudo id="jlwm5j"
FUNCTION createTextStyle(name):

  style =
      clone(defaultTextStyle)

  style.name = name

  registry.add(style)
```

---

# ✏️ MODIFY

```pseudo id="jlwm5k"
FUNCTION modifyTextStyle(name,props):

  style =
      registry.get(name)

  APPLY props
```

---

# 🔤 5. TEXT Entity Reference

---

# TEXT Entity

```pseudo id="jlwm5l"
TextEntity {

  content

  position

  rotation

  styleId
}
```

---

# 🚀 Text does NOT store:

* final font
* resolved size

Renderer resolves dynamically.

---

# 📐 6. Text Rendering Pipeline

---

# STEP 1

```pseudo id="jlwm5m"
style =
    registry.get(
        entity.styleId
    )
```

---

# STEP 2

Apply:

* font
* oblique
* width factor
* height

---

# STEP 3

Render:

* SDF text
* sprite text
* vector SHX later

---

# ⚡ 7. Oblique Angle

Classic CAD slanted text.

---

# Transform

```pseudo id="jlwm5n"
x' =
    x + tan(oblique)*y
```

---

# 🚀 Same as AutoCAD oblique text.

---

# 📏 8. Width Factor

---

# Horizontal Scale

```pseudo id="jlwm5o"
x *= widthFactor
```

---

# Example

| Factor | Result    |
| ------ | --------- |
| 1.0    | normal    |
| 0.8    | condensed |
| 1.2    | expanded  |

---

# 🔥 9. Important Production Architecture

---

# NEVER bake style properties permanently.

Always:

```text id="t7vc4h"
entity → style reference → renderer
```

---

# This enables:

✅ global edits
✅ standards support
✅ theme switching
✅ engineering consistency

---

# 🧠 Final CAD Architecture

```text id="6khmxl"
Entity
    ↓
Style Resolver
    ↓
Viewport Layout Engine
    ↓
Renderer
```

